      "content": "hey i'm so sorry i'm a mess but my son is really sick with an ear infection. the doctor gave us amoxicillin but the bottle says 250mg per 5ml and i'm super confused. he's 15kg and the instructions say 40mg per kilo per day. how many ml do i actually put in the syringe for him? i need to give it to him right now thanks",
